---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-US', {
  year: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
}).format(new Date());
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Games by Feel"
  description="Privacy policy for Games by Feel, including our affiliate disclosure, the data we do not collect and the third-party services used on this static site."
  narrow
>
  <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to home</a>

  <section class="hero legal-hero">
    <div class="hero__body">
      <div class="hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
        <h1 class="hero__title">A static site, minimal data.</h1>
        <p class="hero__lead">
          Games by Feel is a statically generated website. There is no account system, no
          newsletter form, no comment box and no behavioural analytics. This page explains
          exactly what that means — including how our affiliate links work.
        </p>
        <nav class="legal-nav" aria-label="Site information">
          <a href="/about/">About</a>
          <a href="/privacy/" aria-current="page">Privacy</a>
          <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="seo-copy seo-copy--legal" aria-label="Affiliate disclosure">
    <div class="seo-copy__inner">
      <h2 class="seo-copy__title">Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Games by Feel participates in affiliate marketing programmes, including the
        Humble Bundle / Impact affiliate programme.</strong> Some outbound links on this site —
        for example links to a game's store page or to a bundle offer — are affiliate links.
        If you click one of those links and make a purchase, we may receive a commission from
        the retailer.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>This costs you nothing extra.</strong> The price you pay is set entirely by the
        retailer and is the same whether you arrive through an affiliate link or directly.
        Not every link on this site is an affiliate link.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Affiliate relationships do not influence our recommendations.</strong> Game
        rankings, feel tags and "why it fits" text are produced by an automated tag-matching
        model from public metadata. We do not accept payment to place, rank or describe a game,
        and we do not boost titles because they pay a higher commission. Commissions help cover
        the cost of running the site.
      </p>
      <p>
        As an Amazon-style disclosure in plain terms: we may earn from qualifying purchases
        made through links on this page. The retailer, not us, processes your order, payment
        and any personal data involved in that purchase.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="seo-copy seo-copy--legal" aria-label="Data we collect">
    <div class="seo-copy__inner">
      <h2 class="seo-copy__title">Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We do not ask you for, and do not store, names, email addresses, passwords, payment
        details or any other personal information. There is no login, no user profile, no
        advertising identifier and no analytics script that builds a history of your visits.
      </p>
      <p>
        Like any website, our hosting provider (Cloudflare Pages) processes standard technical
        request data — such as IP address, browser user agent, requested URL and timestamps —
        in order to deliver pages and protect the site from abuse. These logs are handled under
        <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>
        and are not used by us to build profiles or to personalise recommendations.
      </p>

      <h2 class="seo-copy__title">Third-party content and links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Game metadata originates from the
          <a href="https://rawg.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">RAWG API</a> and is
          baked into static HTML at build time.
        </li>
        <li>
          Covers, screenshots and trailers are loaded from Steam's
          <code>steamstatic.com</code> CDN. Playing a trailer makes a request to that CDN.
        </li>
        <li>
          Share buttons open twitter.com / reddit.com in a new window; outbound store and
          bundle links go to the respective retailer, including Humble Bundle / Impact.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Once you follow an outbound link or interact with an embedded third-party service,
        that third party's own privacy policy and cookie practices apply. We do not control
        those services and do not receive the personal data you give them. See our
        <a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a> for more detail.
      </p>

      <h2 class="seo-copy__title">Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This site is a general-audience game discovery catalogue and is not directed at children
        under 13. Because we do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone, there is
        no personal data about children for us to delete.
      </p>

      <h2 class="seo-copy__title">Changes and contact</h2>
      <p>
        This policy may be updated as the site evolves; the revision date below always reflects
        the latest version. If you have a question about this policy or about a recommendation,
        the store page linked from any game card is the fastest route to authoritative
        information about that title.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="legal-updated">Last updated {lastUpdated}.</p>
</SiteLayout>
